description:
Successful leaders have many qualities that help them achieve success, such as: 
- Vision: A good leader is articulate in their goals, and is able to articulate a clear plan of action for achieving them;
- Communication: A leader should have strong communication skills, both when talking with their team, as well as talking publicly;
- Self-confidence: Leaders should have faith in themselves, their team and their vision; 
- Goal-oriented: A leader should be focused on results-oriented management;
